## 2026-04-24 - US-014
- What was implemented: Created `src/client/db/pull-sync.ts` with `pullSync(db, fetchFn?)` that reads `lastPullAt` from a new `sync_meta` single-row table, calls `/api/sync?since=<lastPullAt>` (or `/api/sync` on first call), upserts feeds and items inside a transaction, and advances `lastPullAt` to `latestUpdatedAt` from the server response. When `storeContent.value === false`, `content` and `description` are stored as NULL. Added `SYNC_META_SQL` to `sqlite-init.ts` and applied it in `openLocalDb`. Added `getLocalDb(did?)` to `db/index.ts` to expose the cached DB for sync calls. Wired pullSync into `state.ts`: runs after `getAdapter()` resolves on startup (if local DB is active) and on the `window.online` event.
