## 2026-04-24 - US-015
- What was implemented: Created `src/client/db/push-sync.ts` exporting `pushSync(db, fetchFn?)` and `PushSyncAuthError`. Drains outbox rows in `id` order, mapping each `op` to the correct REST endpoint. 2xx → delete row; 5xx/network error → increment `attempts`/`last_error`; 409 → upsert server's authoritative row then delete; 401 → throw `PushSyncAuthError` and halt. Wired `pushSync` into `state.ts` to run after every successful `pullSync` and on the `online` event.
